<title>MEXICO: GCC to propose dividend payment.</title>
<headline>GCC to propose dividend payment.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board at Mexican cement maker Grupo Cementos de Chihuahua will propose a dividend payment at a forthcoming shareholders' assembly. The amount will be determined at the meeting, the company said.</p>
<p>The assembly will take place April 29, a GCC statement said.</p>
<p>(( --Monterrey newsroom +528 345-7617))</p>
